{
    "pageid": 5723,
    "title": "After the End Fan Fork",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "After the End Fan Fork is a fan-made continuation of the original post-apocalyptic North America mod for Crusader Kings 2, After the End ."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Notable new features",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Added Judaism to AtE, along with a new heresy (Reform Judaism) and five playable Jewish characters in the Eastern US and Quebec. (Requires Sons of Abraham DLC)",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Added several denominations of Islam -- Traditionalist, Imamite, and Orientalist.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Added Monastic Feudalism for Gaian realms.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Renamed High Church to Anglicanism and split it off from Evangelical Christianity - Anglicanism is now an independent religion in the Christian group. Anglicanism also has two heresies - Anglo-Catholicism and United Church.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Added two new Native American cultures to the map and split up the existing native cultures into six new culture groups (Eastern Woodlands, Algonquian, Plains, Plateau, Northwest Coast, and Subarctic)",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Adjusted de jure setup in the Northeast and SoCal - Deitschrei is now a de jure kingdom, and the Channel Islands are part of their own de jure duchy.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Added a new province - Isla Socorro, off the coast of Baja California.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Added secret religions and Satanism",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Added a new Catholic heresy - Nestorianism",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Added a bunch of new societies, such as the Men in Black, the Ivy League, and the Bankers' Guild.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Added a bunch of new religions to the map.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Updated the map with new counties.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The Empire of Brazil now rules south of the map. Beware..",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
